error: the data folder ~/Dropbox/.cartograph is inside a sync client's folder
  why: sync clients upload SQLite's -wal and -shm files separately, which corrupts the index (B1)
  try: set CARTOGRAPH_HOME or index_path to a folder outside the synced one
